ad across multiple paths. With each playthrough, choose a new journey through the universe of Spica!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/spica-adventure--1", "videos": [{"id": 155635, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ZPTXvcvFjuU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZPTXvcvFjuU", "title": "G-MODE\u30a2\u30fc\u30ab\u30a4\u30d6\u30b9+ \u30b9\u30d4\u30ab\u30a2\u30c9\u30d9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3000\u7d39\u4ecb\u52d5\u753b", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZPTXvcvFjuU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189864, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "619gVF8p1dc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=619gVF8p1dc", "title": "Spica Adventure - Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/619gVF8p1dc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}